---@class workos.DataIntegrationVendedCredentialCase0
---@field object string Distinguishes the credential object.
---@field auth_method string The authentication method for this credential. Additional values may be added in the future; handle unknown values gracefully.
---@field value string The vended secret. An OAuth access token when `auth_method` is `oauth`, the API key when `api_key`, or the client-credentials access token when `client_credentials`.
